  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "All species are isoelectronic $\\left(10 \\mathrm{e}^{-}\\right)$. \nisoelectronic series, when negative charge increases the radius of ion increases.\n$\\therefore \\mathrm{Mg}^{2+} < \\mathrm{Na}^{+} < \\mathrm{F}^{-} < \\mathrm{O}^{2-}$",
